	<h1 itemprop="name" class="PostTitle"><a href="../../blog/dana-white-orders-conor-mcgregor-to-defend-ufc-lightweight-title-vs-tony-ferguson-in-return-to-octagon/index.html">Dana White orders Conor McGregor to defend UFC lightweight title vs Tony Ferguson in return to Octagon</a></h1>
	<div class="BlockContent">
		<p class="NewsDate" style="margin: 0; color:#6e6e6e;">Posted by 
			<span itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Person">
				<span itemprop="name">Jack Rathborn</span>
